{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0716A0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"博士，你在研究室里抽的是什么？看起来像<R=香烟,CIGARETTE>，但没点火。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=香烟,CIGARETTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"啊，那是我做的电气式香烟。也可以叫电子烟吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"电子烟？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"对。把滤嘴里的液体雾化，再吸入那些微粒。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"原来那是雾。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"其实我想抽普通香烟，不过在那个房间里不行……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"香烟的烟雾对精密设备来说可是毒物，会妨碍电路接触。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"但那种雾只是水蒸气，不含焦油之类的物质。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"所以在研究室里抽也没问题。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"哦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"要试试吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"不，我抽<R=雪茄,CIGAR>就行。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=雪茄,CIGAR>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":37,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"不过……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我不喜欢用替代品糊弄自己。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"是啊。不过吸烟迟早会在全世界受到谴责，因为既伤害自己，也伤害别人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"我觉得电子烟也不错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"嗯，等真到了那时候再考虑吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""}]}